<p>Two components sit behind this page. <code>pop-css</code> builds a stylesheet as objects — selectors, media
queries, comments — renders it, parses one back, and minifies it. <code>pop-color</code> is the value type those
properties hold: one class per color space, converting between twelve of them, and used by <code>pop-image</code>
and <code>pop-pdf</code> as well.</p>
