<h2 id="generating-css">Generating CSS<a class="anchor" href="#generating-css" aria-label="Link to this section">#</a></h2>

<p>A stylesheet is a <code>Pop\Css\Css</code> object holding <code>Pop\Css\Selector</code> objects. A selector takes any valid
CSS selector string and a set of properties:</p>
<div class="code-window" x-data="copyCode">
<div class="code-window-bar"><span class="code-lang">PHP</span><button type="button" class="code-copy" @click="copy()" :aria-label="copied ? 'Copied' : 'Copy code'" aria-label="Copy code"><svg x-show="!copied" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="13" height="13" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="9" y="9" width="11.5" height="11.5" rx="2.4"></rect><path d="M15 5.6A2.6 2.6 0 0 0 12.4 3H5.6A2.6 2.6 0 0 0 3 5.6v6.8A2.6 2.6 0 0 0 5.6 15"></path></svg><svg x-show="copied" x-cloak class="code-copied" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="13" height="13" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4.5 12.5 9 17l10.5-10.5"></path></svg></button></div>
<pre><code><span class="text-kw">use</span> <span class="text-type">Pop\Css\Css</span>;
<span class="text-kw">use</span> <span class="text-type">Pop\Css\Selector</span>;

<span class="text-var">$css</span> = <span class="text-kw">new</span> <span class="text-type">Css</span>();

<span class="text-var">$html</span> = <span class="text-kw">new</span> <span class="text-type">Selector</span>(<span class="text-str">&#039;html&#039;</span>);
<span class="text-var">$html</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">setProperties</span>([
    <span class="text-str">&#039;margin&#039;</span>           =&gt; <span class="text-num">0</span>,
    <span class="text-str">&#039;padding&#039;</span>          =&gt; <span class="text-num">0</span>,
    <span class="text-str">&#039;background-color&#039;</span> =&gt; <span class="text-str">&#039;#fff&#039;</span>,
]);

<span class="text-var">$login</span> = <span class="text-kw">new</span> <span class="text-type">Selector</span>(<span class="text-str">&#039;#login&#039;</span>);
<span class="text-var">$login</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">setProperty</span>(<span class="text-str">&#039;margin&#039;</span>, <span class="text-num">0</span>)
      -&gt;<span class="text-fn">setProperty</span>(<span class="text-str">&#039;padding&#039;</span>, <span class="text-num">0</span>);

<span class="text-var">$css</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">addSelectors</span>([<span class="text-var">$html</span>, <span class="text-var">$login</span>]);

<span class="text-kw">echo</span> <span class="text-var">$css</span>;
</code></pre>
</div>

